WEBVTT

00:31.460 --> 00:33.680
They're so cute!

00:33.680 --> 00:39.380
So cute, so cute, so cute...

00:41.060 --> 00:43.190
What is going on here?

00:43.190 --> 00:45.690
Why are you asking me that?

00:45.690 --> 00:48.200
You got us into this mess.

00:48.200 --> 00:49.860
<i>You fix it.</i>

00:49.860 --> 00:50.930
Cute!

00:51.700 --> 00:55.960
I clearly remember opposing 
the idea, but you...

01:06.310 --> 01:07.840
You're the last one.

01:08.170 --> 01:09.470
Wait, wait!

01:09.780 --> 01:13.220
I'll go with those two.

01:13.870 --> 01:14.980
What are you saying?

01:15.750 --> 01:18.030
I'm not going without them.

01:23.190 --> 01:24.990
Hurry up and go already.

01:25.620 --> 01:26.740
Shut up!

01:32.490 --> 01:34.320
I'm going to look for them.

01:34.320 --> 01:35.750
If I can't, then...

01:38.830 --> 01:42.520
You don't get it.

01:43.910 --> 01:48.550
Sometimes you lose everything 
while trying to protect something.

01:49.140 --> 01:52.890
Learn to tell the difference between 
what you want and reality.

01:54.550 --> 01:58.360
Even if I climb the Tower that way, I...

02:00.640 --> 02:02.990
<i>No wonder Bam helped them.</i>

02:05.190 --> 02:06.430
Do what you want.

02:07.280 --> 02:08.650
Uh...

02:08.650 --> 02:10.660
We'll find them.

02:10.660 --> 02:14.600
Khun, I knew from the moment we met

02:14.600 --> 02:16.470
that I could get through to you!

02:16.470 --> 02:21.790
I'm just helping you find them.
After that, it's up to you. Got that?

02:22.430 --> 02:24.080
Okay.

02:26.490 --> 02:30.020
Sheesh. I was just asking a question.

02:31.350 --> 02:33.260
I've seen her before...

02:44.170 --> 02:45.690
Verdi?

02:46.240 --> 02:49.200
That's the puppet user on Shibisu's team.

02:49.520 --> 02:51.420
All right, let's go.

02:51.420 --> 02:53.580
There's no avoiding it now.

02:53.580 --> 02:54.200
<i>Don't move!</i>

02:55.200 --> 02:56.180
What?

02:56.650 --> 02:58.200
<i>If you want to live, don't move!</i>

02:58.200 --> 02:59.080
Huh?

02:59.080 --> 03:02.050
What's going on? Hey, Khun!

03:03.120 --> 03:04.510
<i>Those idiots...</i>

03:09.830 --> 03:13.140
Blue Turtle...

04:44.020 --> 04:48.020
<b>Episode 16</b>

04:44.020 --> 04:48.020
<b>The 25th Bam</b>

05:05.820 --> 05:06.860
Viole...

05:08.770 --> 05:10.540
I'll kill you!

05:18.360 --> 05:20.550
Where have you been?

05:21.060 --> 05:22.110
Novick.

05:24.030 --> 05:26.690
You're wounded. Did Anaak do that to you?

05:26.690 --> 05:28.930
Huh? Oh...

05:50.390 --> 05:52.260
Something like that.

05:53.100 --> 05:57.920
Anyway, we've been in total 
chaos because you're gone.

05:58.300 --> 05:59.590
I'm sorry.

06:00.520 --> 06:01.840
It's fine, but...

06:01.840 --> 06:06.310
Why did you shoot that 
lizard with a light shot?

06:06.960 --> 06:09.100
You could've taken her out with a dark shot.

06:09.800 --> 06:11.030
Because...

06:11.030 --> 06:12.230
<i>Viole.</i>

06:13.570 --> 06:15.980
There are intruders in 
the first floor hallway.

06:16.500 --> 06:18.230
Two have entered from below.

06:18.590 --> 06:21.490
One is a Scout. The other's 
position is unknown.

06:22.180 --> 06:24.320
They're heading toward 
the central staircase.

06:33.630 --> 06:36.190
They don't seem to be Endorsi Jahad.

06:36.190 --> 06:38.610
We could probably catch them with a pincer.

06:38.610 --> 06:39.630
We can't.

06:39.630 --> 06:40.620
What?

06:41.010 --> 06:43.380
Neither Princess of Jahad is here!

06:43.380 --> 06:45.640
We'll never get another chance like this!

06:45.640 --> 06:51.590
The man I know wouldn't send 
Anaak alone while he snuck in.

06:51.590 --> 06:54.150
He must have a plan.

06:54.880 --> 06:56.900
<i>"The man I know"?</i>

06:57.430 --> 07:00.380
I have a request.

07:00.780 --> 07:01.630
Huh?

07:11.060 --> 07:12.550
Need any backup?

07:13.570 --> 07:15.250
I'll go alone.

07:15.250 --> 07:18.500
Have the others search 
around the hotel, as well.

07:19.300 --> 07:21.400
I'm counting on you.

07:42.400 --> 07:45.410
Such an impudent human...

07:50.170 --> 07:53.440
Adjust your aim. Maintain that angle.

07:53.820 --> 07:55.040
Wait a while longer.

07:56.630 --> 07:58.130
Now! Fire!

08:00.590 --> 08:03.340
Even if they dodge it, 
if we block their retreat...

08:08.470 --> 08:09.720
This is the end!

08:14.980 --> 08:16.480
Is that...

08:18.030 --> 08:20.360
Are you all right, Yuto?

08:20.360 --> 08:22.970
Forgive me, Viole.

08:24.090 --> 08:26.610
I'm sorry. I'm going to tear your clothes.

08:28.800 --> 08:30.940
Long hair in a ponytail.

08:31.730 --> 08:35.370
Unlike the rumors, you have a boyish build.

08:37.310 --> 08:40.470
Are you Jue Viole Grace?

08:44.710 --> 08:46.250
I've been hoping to meet you.

08:48.520 --> 08:51.630
Neither of us would benefit 
from fighting here.

08:52.320 --> 08:53.810
Could I ask you to turn back?

08:54.140 --> 08:55.820
No can do.

08:55.820 --> 08:58.990
We don't care about the Workshop Battle.

08:59.470 --> 09:02.480
We came here to capture you.

09:03.920 --> 09:07.240
I'm not losing any more teammates.

09:08.290 --> 09:10.700
I don't care if I don't make 
it onto the <i>Archimedes</i>.

09:10.970 --> 09:13.950
I'll do whatever it takes to crush you.

09:27.480 --> 09:29.000
What is she doing?

09:29.000 --> 09:29.940
<i>What is it?</i>

09:30.270 --> 09:32.930
Well... The giant octopus...

09:37.240 --> 09:38.290
It's glowing.

09:39.570 --> 09:41.230
<i>Those idiots...</i>

09:41.230 --> 09:42.820
<i>I have no choice.</i>

09:43.230 --> 09:46.250
Do something about it.

09:46.250 --> 09:48.410
<i>Huh? Like what?</i>

09:48.790 --> 09:50.060
I don't know, anything.

09:50.060 --> 09:50.740
You might as well try throwing 
those goofy bombs at it.

09:50.740 --> 09:53.810
<i>You might as well try throwing 
those goofy bombs at it.</i>

09:53.810 --> 09:56.860
Huh? Bombs? Will those 
work against an octopus?

09:56.860 --> 09:59.000
<i>I don't know. Now hurry up.</i>

10:00.220 --> 10:02.660
<i>First you tell me not to move, 
now you're telling me to go.</i>

10:02.660 --> 10:04.020
<i>Which is it?</i>

10:04.020 --> 10:06.260
If you have time to complain...

10:32.960 --> 10:35.660
That ring is called Reina.

10:36.180 --> 10:38.890
It absorbs your Shinsu and sends it

10:38.890 --> 10:44.530
underground through that 
octopus, nullifying its power.

10:47.230 --> 10:52.910
In other words, it's a tool for 
suppressing a Wave Controller's Shinsu.

11:00.700 --> 11:02.530
Don't bother trying to remove it.

11:02.980 --> 11:05.000
It's impossible.

11:08.090 --> 11:13.990
You're a skilled Wave Controller, but your 
physical abilities are underwhelming.

11:21.500 --> 11:27.000
In other words, beating you 
without your Shinsu will be easy.

11:28.960 --> 11:30.170
Do you understand now?

11:30.820 --> 11:39.220
We came here because we knew we 
could capture you, Jue Viole Grace.

11:41.130 --> 11:42.480
I'll beat you to a pulp!

11:45.140 --> 11:49.610
Humans are so slow when 
they can't use Shinsu!

11:53.200 --> 11:54.630
That jerk...

11:56.800 --> 11:58.620
Stay out of my way!

12:03.040 --> 12:04.290
<i>He's faster than I thought.</i>

12:23.720 --> 12:25.480
You're finished, human!

12:26.980 --> 12:27.920
Viole!

12:28.970 --> 12:29.900
Yuto!

12:31.400 --> 12:34.500
Viole...

12:36.410 --> 12:39.630
Yuto? Yuto!

12:40.060 --> 12:41.330
Don't bother.

12:41.330 --> 12:45.120
My needle is coated with 
a fast-acting poison.

12:46.400 --> 12:48.930
Unless this honey is applied 
within five minutes,

12:48.930 --> 12:52.630
the poison will spread throughout 
her body and kill her.

12:57.130 --> 13:00.680
Will you get on your knees 
and beg for my honey, human?

13:00.680 --> 13:02.660
Not that I'd give it to you anyway.

13:10.070 --> 13:12.900
If you don't stop hurting my friends...

13:36.850 --> 13:38.170
What's going on?

13:43.990 --> 13:46.140
You're impudent for a human!

13:46.140 --> 13:46.890
Wait!

13:50.500 --> 13:51.990
This is the end!

13:57.820 --> 13:58.820
From that position?

14:05.110 --> 14:06.380
Do you want to keep fighting?

14:08.940 --> 14:14.350
<i>He improved his physical abilities in a 
short amount of time without using Shinsu.</i>

14:16.920 --> 14:21.020
<i>Everything changed when that light appeared.</i>

14:21.840 --> 14:22.650
<i>What should we do?</i>

14:23.260 --> 14:25.930
<i>Fighting him without knowing his 
abilities puts us at a disadvantage.</i>

14:26.240 --> 14:30.150
<i>But it's a fact that he can't use Shinsu.</i>

14:30.920 --> 14:34.090
<i>And we can't retreat now.</i>

14:34.940 --> 14:36.440
It looks like this is the end.

14:38.220 --> 14:42.950
If you give me the honey and your bullets,
 I'll release these two.

14:46.950 --> 14:49.500
Screw you! I told you already!

14:49.960 --> 14:52.460
Getting revenge on you has 
been our goal from the start!

14:52.690 --> 14:56.960
All the more reason you 
should accept my offer.

14:58.230 --> 15:04.720
If you refuse, I will abandon my teammates, 
shoot that man, and board the ship.

15:05.030 --> 15:10.740
You're welcome to refuse if your 
revenge would end with Yuto's death.

15:10.740 --> 15:12.480
Bastard...

15:12.700 --> 15:15.730
Now leave peacefully and hand 
over the honey and bullets.

15:15.730 --> 15:17.480
Screw you, human!

15:17.930 --> 15:20.490
You don't stand a chance 
against my adult form!

15:20.490 --> 15:21.490
Vespa!

15:25.010 --> 15:28.240
Fine. We'll give you the honey and bullets.

15:29.010 --> 15:30.700
So return Vespa to us.

15:30.700 --> 15:31.620
Leader!

15:32.080 --> 15:35.750
Shoot Amigo with a light shot, 
and I'll remove the ring for you.

15:35.750 --> 15:39.260
But he can't use Shinsu right now.

15:39.260 --> 15:41.260
Give him the honey.

15:42.250 --> 15:43.260
Why?

15:43.850 --> 15:46.190
I'm this team's brain.

15:46.540 --> 15:49.520
I recognize the difference between 
what I want and reality.

15:51.170 --> 15:52.350
Don't worry.

15:52.850 --> 15:56.770
Out of all of us, I'm most 
familiar with losing.

15:57.340 --> 16:03.240
So I know all too well that sometimes 
running really is winning.

16:04.700 --> 16:08.370
This is the end for now. We're leaving.

16:09.880 --> 16:11.720
<i>Verdi, can you hear me?</i>

16:11.720 --> 16:13.850
Oh, good timing.

16:13.850 --> 16:17.130
I was just about to report to you.

16:17.130 --> 16:17.920
<i>What's up?</i>

16:17.920 --> 16:20.420
A big guy showed up.

16:24.110 --> 16:25.680
Horyang.

16:25.680 --> 16:28.680
Can I make him my puppet?

16:28.900 --> 16:32.600
No. Head to our meeting place.

16:32.600 --> 16:35.190
We're boarding the <i>Archimedes</i>. Got it?

16:35.190 --> 16:36.730
Too bad.

16:37.480 --> 16:39.190
See you later, mister.

16:39.540 --> 16:40.390
Wait!

16:41.680 --> 16:43.720
Release Prince and Miseng!

16:43.720 --> 16:44.700
Wangnan?

16:44.700 --> 16:46.100
I don't think so.

16:46.100 --> 16:49.200
I'm going to make these two my puppets.

16:49.200 --> 16:52.200
What? Don't be ridiculous!

16:52.200 --> 16:54.290
I'm not letting that happen!

16:55.940 --> 16:57.080
Well, sorry.

16:57.740 --> 16:58.630
Wangnan!

16:59.210 --> 17:01.380
See you on the ship.

17:02.220 --> 17:03.210
Wait!

17:05.720 --> 17:07.460
Prince! Miseng!

17:09.740 --> 17:10.910
Damn it.

17:21.750 --> 17:24.240
Whoa, whoa! Hey, wait! Wait!

17:27.060 --> 17:29.740
Wait up, Horyang! Horyang!

17:31.490 --> 17:33.960
Where have you—

17:33.960 --> 17:34.950
I'm sorry.

17:35.490 --> 17:37.000
Don't say anything. Just leave.

17:38.290 --> 17:40.100
Did you get to see your friend?

17:41.350 --> 17:44.800
In any case, everyone wants to see you.

17:44.800 --> 17:47.010
I know. Let's go get 
something to eat together.

17:47.010 --> 17:49.400
We can't be together anymore.

17:58.330 --> 18:00.900
You'll keep your promise, won't you?

18:03.740 --> 18:06.070
Don't expect things to go 
this way on the <i>Archimedes</i>.

18:06.070 --> 18:09.540
Not that anything I say now means anything.

18:10.250 --> 18:14.790
But I can't laugh after seeing you 
trying to save a teammate's life.

18:18.690 --> 18:20.090
Not bad.

18:21.050 --> 18:24.170
What about my request?

18:24.170 --> 18:25.620
No problem.

18:25.620 --> 18:30.090
I used the bullet you gave 
me to send Reflejo upstairs.

18:30.780 --> 18:34.310
He cooperated when I told him 
I was acting on your orders.

18:35.220 --> 18:36.540
Thank you.

18:37.210 --> 18:39.710
But why do that?

18:42.160 --> 18:46.520
If you keep trying to do everything 
yourself, you'll break.

18:46.520 --> 18:51.950
As long as everyone else is safe,
I don't mind if I break.

18:53.810 --> 18:57.030
I don't have a reason to live anymore.

18:58.970 --> 19:00.540
We should head up.

19:01.000 --> 19:02.970
There aren't many boarding passes left.

19:03.370 --> 19:04.320
Yeah.

19:13.710 --> 19:15.600
Why did we retreat?

19:15.600 --> 19:17.420
It's complicated.

19:17.420 --> 19:19.510
But I could've kept playing.

19:19.510 --> 19:23.100
Maybe it was right to back off then.

19:25.070 --> 19:28.210
<i>I was blinded by revenge 
and underestimated him.</i>

19:28.840 --> 19:35.060
<i>When he has access to his Shinsu, he's as 
strong as the top five E-rank Regulars.</i>

19:35.550 --> 19:37.000
<i>Then there's that...</i>

19:45.380 --> 19:47.650
So, who are they?

19:47.650 --> 19:50.750
Aren't my puppets cute?

19:50.750 --> 19:52.900
Did some weird bug bite you again?

19:53.450 --> 19:54.390
Nothing.

19:55.030 --> 19:56.640
In any case, we're boarding the ship.

19:56.640 --> 19:58.640
Okay, Leader.

20:02.390 --> 20:03.650
See you later.

20:07.670 --> 20:09.900
You're happy-go-lucky, aren't you?

20:15.540 --> 20:16.840
Next time.

20:40.430 --> 20:43.710
Sorry. I said I'd handle it, but...

20:43.710 --> 20:45.470
Blue Turtle.

21:05.380 --> 21:08.460
Why won't they leave me alone?

21:08.460 --> 21:13.490
How dare you make me deal 
with these, Jue Viole Grace?

21:13.490 --> 21:15.970
I'll kill you the next time we meet.

21:23.900 --> 21:25.320
You, with the goggles!

21:28.970 --> 21:30.390
Tell me!

21:30.390 --> 21:32.810
Where is Jue Viole Grace?

21:32.810 --> 21:34.200
I don't know!

21:34.200 --> 21:35.490
Don't play dumb!

21:35.490 --> 21:36.940
It's true!

21:36.940 --> 21:38.740
Besides, that's not him!

21:38.740 --> 21:39.560
Huh?

21:39.560 --> 21:44.140
That isn't Jue Viole Grace.
He's the 25th Bam.

21:44.140 --> 21:47.750
What? He's obviously Jue Viole Grace.

21:47.750 --> 21:49.600
Why would the 25th Bam—

21:58.910 --> 22:03.500
What did you just call him?

23:36.400 --> 23:38.780
So cute!

23:38.780 --> 23:40.990
This is so weird...

23:39.050 --> 23:41.250
<b>Next Time
Funky!</b>
